404	// ── Muon (STAGED grid-cooperative Newton-Schulz) per-matrix scratch. IDENTICAL in
405	//    shape to the vit twin (vit_tc_muon_floats): the NS chain runs ONE 2D weight at
406	//    a time over all CTAs; the scratch holds X/A/AX/AAX/orth for the LARGEST 2D weight
407	//    + the per-CTA Frobenius-norm partials + inv_norm. The momentum buffer (muon_buf)
